@EnergiaDistrital_HostAddress = http://localhost:5157

### Estado del servicio
GET {{EnergiaDistrital_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Resumen del distrito
GET {{EnergiaDistrital_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard
Accept: application/json

### Zonas
GET {{EnergiaDistrital_HostAddress}}/api/zones
Accept: application/json

### Medidores
GET {{EnergiaDistrital_HostAddress}}/api/meters
Accept: application/json

### Mapa operativo
GET {{EnergiaDistrital_HostAddress}}/api/map
Accept: application/json

### Lecturas recientes
GET {{EnergiaDistrital_HostAddress}}/api/readings?limit=24
Accept: application/json

### Alertas
GET {{EnergiaDistrital_HostAddress}}/api/alerts
Accept: application/json

### Generar una ronda de lecturas simuladas
POST {{EnergiaDistrital_HostAddress}}/api/simulator/tick
Accept: application/json

### TinyML Lab V0.7
GET http://localhost:5157/api/tinyml?zoneId=distrito-san-borja
Accept: application/json
